  "description": "Laria, the leader of the Golden Deer Knights of Nixia.  \nShe leaves to find the Crown Prince Bolonis, who was falsely accused and exiled.  \nWith the help of a mysterious sorcerer, she comes to Korea where Crown Prince Jo is.\n\nLaria meets Volonis, who has lost her memory, but  \nShe is enchanted and, under certain conditions, becomes a dog. She becomes a human being.\n\nWhile going through the case of targeting the crown prince and various difficulties,  \nUnknown from Nyxia, she slowly comes to know the Crown Prince's heart.\n\nShe wonders if she can get back to Nyxia safely with the Crown Prince and clear him of his name. (MTL)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://m.comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=794192), [Naver Series](https://m.series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=8365482)",
